[[Sophie Casterwill]] used this spell to protect the team when Dante used [[Ignatius]]'s flames to burn away [[Klaus]]'s mutant flying spiders. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}} 

The [[Mermen]] of [[Atlantis]] used this spell to defend themselves from Dante Vale's [[Doublespell]] [[Boltflare]] in the Test of Prowess. {{source|Coming of Age}}

Sophie again used this spell to protect herself from the effect of [[Kiel]]'s [[Fireswarm]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

This spell was preemptively used by [[Dante Vale]] to protect him from Kiel's [[Armorburn]] in the massive war against the [[Blood Spiral|Blood Spirals]] next to the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. In the same war, Sophie later used Chillskin in the exact same way versus Kiel next to the fortress' door. {{Source|The Spiral War}}

